{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Summary\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>What on earth is this school?! </strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/intro01.png?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird encounters happened to Natsumi on the first day of her transference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Counseling Teacher looking for trouble, the Principal with religious fanaticism, and Classmates with absurd common sense ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meeting classmates and teachers with unique personalities at the start of the semester, can she get used to school life from now on?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Controls\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/2025-02-24_11-00-02.mkv_snapshot_00.55.641.png?t=1744096321\" />\u25b2Game Objective: Players must increase their intelligence and stamina to at least 20 within 20 days!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/ccfja-uyyaq.gif?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b2Use arrow keys to control Natsumi and use the Z key to interact with classmates and teachers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/zr458-40nh3.gif?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b2Attend classes and increase knowledge!<br>Although sometimes it might be a self-study period ...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/\u87a2\u5e55\u64f7\u53d6\u756b\u9762_2025-02-24_113430.png?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b2Because this is an absurd academy, sparring with classmates is a compulsory subject!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/intro05.png?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b2Utilize each function in the academy to its best to improve your abilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Protagonist\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/stand01a2.png?t=1744096321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b2Natsumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A normal girl. She is living with her granny because her father is working abroad.She just transferred to a new school and is quite nervous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Side Characters\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/extras/\u89d2\u8272\u5361_2_EN.png?t=1744096321\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326920?t=1744096321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744096321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/29d66e6bf42ca3d2d3c0219d84963fc203127d4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744096321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326920/29d66e6bf42ca3d2d3c0219d84963fc203127d4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744096321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game's combat system features extremely dangerous items (e.g., stun guns, poison, etc.) for exaggerated effect. This is purely fictional, please do not attempt to imitat